Subject: fix typos in sml(1) man page

Forwarded: https://github.com/smlnj/legacy/pull/384
---
 doc/man/man1/sml.1 | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/doc/man/man1/sml.1 b/doc/man/man1/sml.1
index 4203057..96e0abc 100644
--- a/doc/man/man1/sml.1
+++ b/doc/man/man1/sml.1
@@ -79,7 +79,7 @@ echo the heap suffix for the system to standard output and then exit
 .sp
 \fB@SMLalloc\fP=\fISIZE\fP
 .RS 4
-Specify the prefered size of the allocation area
+Specify the preferred size of the allocation area
 .RE
 .sp
 \fB@SMLrun\fP=\fIRUNTIME\fP
@@ -150,8 +150,8 @@ list all the controls along with their default value
 \fB\-s\fP\fIlevel\fP
 .RS 4
 print a limited list of settings.
