-just the root of the heirarchy.
+The number of levels of the control hierarchy is controlled by \fIlevel\fP, with 0 printing
+just the root of the hierarchy.
 .RE
 .sp
 \fB\-E\fP
@@ -162,8 +162,8 @@ list all the controls along with their corresponding environment variables
 \fB\-e\fP\fIlevel\fP
 .RS 4
 print a limited list of environment variables;
-The number of levels of the control heirarchy is controled by \fIlevel\fP, with 0 printing
-just the root of the heirarchy.
+The number of levels of the control hierarchy is controlled by \fIlevel\fP, with 0 printing
